sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant API as HubWebController
    participant HubService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Worker as route-worker
    participant Map as Kakao / Naver Map API
    participant Outbox as Outbox Publisher
    participant Kafka
    participant Shipping as 배송 서비스

    Client->>API: POST /api/v1/hubs
    API->>HubService: create(CreateHubCommand)
    HubService->>DB: 같은 트랜잭션<br/>Hub · Route skeleton · RouteBuildJob 저장
    DB-->>HubService: commit
    HubService-->>API: HubRes(status=PENDING/COMPLETE)
    API-->>Client: 201 Created

    Worker->>Worker: ShedLock 획득
    Worker->>DB: Route Pair 하나 선점<br/>PENDING → PROCESSING
    DB-->>Worker: 선점 트랜잭션 커밋
    Note over Worker,Map: 지도 API 호출 중 DB 트랜잭션 없음
    Worker->>Map: 거리·시간 조회
    Map-->>Worker: RouteWeight
    Worker->>DB: Route 2행 COMPLETE<br/>remaining_count 감소
    Worker->>DB: 최종 성공 시<br/>Job COMPLETE · Hub COMPLETE
    DB->>Outbox: BEFORE_COMMIT<br/>HubCreatedEvent 저장
    DB-->>Worker: commit
    Outbox->>Kafka: AFTER_COMMIT 발행
    Kafka-->>Shipping: Hub/Route 변경 이벤트
    Shipping->>Shipping: 최단 경로 캐시 무효화

    alt 일시 오류
        Worker->>DB: Route PENDING<br/>next_retry_at + backoff
    else 최대 재시도 초과 또는 영구 오류
        Worker->>DB: Route FAILED<br/>failed_count 증가
        DB->>DB: Job FAILED · Hub FAILED
    end
